- Replaced the `if !metadata.is_file() { continue; } files.push(...)` pair with a single `if metadata.is_file() { files.push(...) }`, removing one line and the early-continue indirection.
- No behavioral change: same error classification, same skip-on-`NotFound`/`NotADirectory` semantics, same propagation of other I/O errors, same filter to regular files only.

