- Replaced the manual loop-and-return with `Array.prototype.find`, which short-circuits identically to the original early `return`.
- Moved the `X_OK`/`isFile` check into the `find` predicate, returning `false` on the caught error instead of falling through the loop.
- Dropped the empty-`dir` `continue` in favor of filtering blank PATH segments out via `.filter(Boolean)` before building candidates.

